== scenario distinct: input=[3, 1, 4, 1] ==
  step 1: (3,0) x (1,1)  gt=True  -> (3,0)
  step 2: (4,2) x (1,3)  gt=True  -> (4,2)
  step 3: (3,0) x (4,2)  gt=False  -> (4,2)
  RESULT: value=4 index=2  (argmax=2)

== scenario tie: input=[4, 4] ==
  step 1: (4,0) x (4,1)  gt=True (tie: 4==4 and 0<1)  -> (4,0)
  RESULT: value=4 index=0  (left index wins)
